## Interface: 16001
## Title: SellAdvice
## Notes: One line in item tooltips: disenchant, vendor or auction, whichever brings the most, from Auctionator's scanned prices. A gold coin marks the quest choice worth the most. With full bags, a red cross in Baganator marks the item cheapest to drop. Hold Alt for the workings. /sell lists everything your characters own, best to sell first.
## Author: Pietjan
## Version: 1.2
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, Baganator, Syndicator, ForeverSnap
## SavedVariables: SellAdviceDB

